50	8. Type mapping per CLAUDE.md:
51	   - MySQL INT(11) AUTO_INCREMENT → PostgreSQL SERIAL / IDENTITY
52	   - MySQL VARCHAR(n) → PostgreSQL VARCHAR(n)
53	   - MySQL TINYINT(1) → PostgreSQL BOOLEAN **IF and ONLY IF** used as a
